   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ために: cause or purpose",
     "texto": [
      "With a noun + **のために** it can express cause: **じこ の ため に、 でんしゃ が とまりました** (because of the accident, the train stopped). With an intentional verb in dictionary form it indicates purpose: **にほんご を べんきょう する ため に、 まいにち よみます** (I read every day to study Japanese)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ように: so that a result is reached",
     "texto": [
      "It usually goes with potential forms, negative forms or verbs expressing a state: **わすれない ように、 メモ を します** (I take a note so as not to forget); **よく きこえる ように、 おおきな こえ で はなします** (I speak loudly so that it can be heard well)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
